  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Welcome to 202 West Tamaki Road - where lifestyle, opportunity, and timeless family living come together in the heart of Glendowie.\r\n\r\nSet within one of Auckland's most sought-after, family-friendly suburbs, this charming residence, extensively extended in 2010 (Plaster with a vented Cavity System), offers more than just a place to live - it's a place to grow, gather, and create lasting memories.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, there's a sense of ease. A thoughtfully designed open-plan living, kitchen, and dining area forms the heart of the home - a space where everyday life unfolds effortlessly, and connection comes naturally.\r\n\r\nThree generous bedrooms (with scope to add a fourth) provide comfort and retreat for the whole family. A dedicated office offers flexibility for modern living - whether you're working from home, studying, or need extra space. Explore adding more value by converting the loft into a fourth bedroom. \r\n\r\nBut it's outside where this property truly comes into its own. Bathed in northern sun, the backyard is something special - reminiscent of a boutique fruit orchard you might stumble across in the French or Italian countryside. It's a space that invites you to slow down, to entertain, and to savour the simple pleasures of life.\r\n\r\nFor families thinking ahead, this is a smart move. A property you can secure today, enjoy immediately, and enhance over time - unlocking even greater value in the years to come. \r\n\r\nThe location only adds to the appeal. With excellent schooling options nearby, public transport right on your doorstep, and the golden sands of St Heliers Beach only minutes away, you're perfectly positioned to enjoy the very best of the Bays lifestyle.\r\n\r\n202 West Tamaki Road is more than move-in ready - it's future-ready.\r\n\r\nKEYWORDS: Sacred Heart College, Glendowie College zone, Crossfield Reserve, Bays Lifestyle, Roberta Reserve, Churchill Club, Fourth bedroom",
